{"game": "mass-effect-3", "language": "english", "appid": 1238020, "month": "2024-09", "window": 1, "start_date": 1725148800, "end_date": 1727740799, "month_true_total": 7, "quota": 7, "returned": 7, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 19:54:46 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "175911043", "author": {"steamid": "76561198019604535", "personaname": "aPanzerIV", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/shutupandmoney/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 42255, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 42255, "last_played": 1727480707, "avatar": "709336863520b2e21551a0000d263748c4d43659"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you *really* want to play this game, this edition has less bugs.\n\nWhere do I start? If you dig deep enough into the development you can find this game was never playtested, and the writing was never peer-reviewed. The massively rushed development is apparent in all aspects of the game, starting with how similar it is to ME2. Over-the-shoulder cover shooters should not exist, should never exist, and its apparent no feedback was taken from its predecessor. The decision to make this a trilogy and end the series right here and now was questionable and resulted in an insane plot pace. A lot of the plot also ignores decisions made in the previous game and largely throws the concept of the series ever being an RPG out the window. You can only interact with the plot with all the depth of a pumkin spice latte and ugg boots. The sequence of burning a field of mary jane while skrillex plays in FC3 aged less terribly than the ubiqitous blue lense flare reminding you IT'S 2012! Most of the availible mods revolve around degenerate topics such as adding more characters to have shreks with, or very bad 720i custom cutscenes made by a 10 year old. There is nothing here to enjoy. I never played this game when it released and after playing it only now in 2024, wish I had never wasted the time.", "timestamp_created": 1727480731, "timestamp_updated": 1728691375, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 4, "weighted_vote_score": "0.360636889934539795", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 6}]}, {"recommendationid": "175898236", "author": {"steamid": "76561198268936005", "personaname": "Meth_Busters", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198268936005/", "num_games_owned": 219, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 3792, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 961, "last_played": 1780964291, "avatar": "a521352ec938d97a89f4b9655f75924d3cea6344"}, "language": "english", "review": "Yes, the multiplayer is as good as you remember. \n\nI tried this on EA's subscription first ($1 trial for one month), I'd recommend that or waiting for a price drop to $10. Your progress transfers to steam, so there's no downside to running a trial first. \n\nGet your friends who have families now and tell them to hop on", "timestamp_created": 1727465301, "timestamp_updated": 1727465301, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.587726712226867676", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "175817423", "author": {"steamid": "76561198099302496", "personaname": "Poxy100", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Poxy100/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 36, "playtime_forever": 3587, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 244, "deck_playtime_at_review": 2, "last_played": 1781210674, "avatar": "14f1a9927382fa8dea134a0f3ca6f17e6938e131"}, "language": "english", "review": "best game in the series in terms of multiplayer.", "timestamp_created": 1727364515, "timestamp_updated": 1727364515, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.519230782985687256", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "175654224", "author": {"steamid": "76561199229757509", "personaname": "DrLionFish", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199229757509/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 3454, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 677, "last_played": 1754763824, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "GOATED multiplayer", "timestamp_created": 1727145967, "timestamp_updated": 1727145967, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.519230782985687256", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "175079636", "author": {"steamid": "76561198296062513", "personaname": "Ardeshir007", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198296062513/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 12259, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 637, "last_played": 1749178347, "avatar": "dfa21a65bd781aa392b4ba22d682d0d6eeae67c7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Worth it just for the multiplayer. The single player game is amazing, but with the LE you're better off with the upgraded version, except for the fact the LE doesn't have multiplayer. I literally bought this just for that.", "timestamp_created": 1726469566, "tim